This module is self-knowledge practice, not psychology. The instrument is a preference questionnaire — useful for reflection, working-style insight, and career-fit hypotheses; it is not a medical device, not a measure of ability or worth, and never a tool for hiring decisions about other people. Treat your type as data about yourself, hold it lightly, and retake it if life changes you. Interstitium Labs confers no certificate.

